{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\164.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "= 8 × 6 × 1.5 = 72 m3", "conf": 0.789, "box": [[369, 89], [736, 78], [737, 118], [371, 129]]}, {"text": "So, the capacity of the swimming pool is 72 cubic metres.", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[97, 176], [1033, 151], [1034, 190], [98, 215]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[96, 247], [286, 244], [287, 288], [97, 291]]}, {"text": "A classroom has dimensions 9 m × 5 m × 8 m. Find the total surface area of the classroom.", "conf": 0.941, "box": [[96, 321], [1593, 293], [1594, 336], [97, 363]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.875, "box": [[96, 399], [255, 399], [255, 436], [96, 436]]}, {"text": " Length of classroom = [ = 9 m", "conf": 0.884, "box": [[83, 465], [589, 467], [589, 517], [83, 515]]}, {"text": "Width of classroom = w = 5 m", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[98, 552], [588, 547], [589, 583], [98, 588]]}, {"text": "Height of classroom = h'= 8 m", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[97, 629], [594, 621], [595, 660], [98, 668]]}, {"text": "Total surface area of classroom = 2 × [(l × w) + (l × h) + (w × h)]", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[98, 704], [1132, 698], [1132, 734], [98, 740]]}, {"text": "[(8 × s) + (8 × 6) + (s × 6)] ×z = ", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[621, 777], [1186, 771], [1187, 814], [622, 820]]}, {"text": "= 2 × [45 + 72 + 40]", "conf": 0.8, "box": [[649, 855], [987, 855], [987, 891], [649, 891]]}, {"text": "=2×157m²=314m²", "conf": 0.809, "box": [[650, 931], [1028, 931], [1028, 967], [650, 967]]}, {"text": "So, the surface area of the classroom is 314 cubic metres.", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[98, 1009], [1040, 1018], [1039, 1058], [98, 1048]]}, {"text": "Example 3:", "conf": 0.807, "box": [[98, 1105], [286, 1108], [285, 1149], [97, 1146]]}, {"text": "A wooden cube shaped-box has a length of 6.5 metres. Find the cost of painting the box at", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[98, 1162], [1629, 1191], [1628, 1231], [97, 1203]]}, {"text": "the rate of Rs 45 per m².", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[98, 1226], [487, 1231], [487, 1271], [97, 1266]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.814, "box": [[98, 1280], [257, 1286], [256, 1327], [97, 1322]]}, {"text": ". To find the cost of painting the box, first we need to find the total surface area which is to", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[89, 1343], [1603, 1380], [1602, 1424], [88, 1386]]}, {"text": "be painted.", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[99, 1404], [285, 1411], [284, 1455], [98, 1448]]}, {"text": "Surface area of cube = 6 × (length)*", "conf": 0.901, "box": [[99, 1467], [685, 1481], [684, 1526], [98, 1512]]}, {"text": "= 6 × (6.5)", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[451, 1539], [632, 1543], [631, 1587], [450, 1583]]}, {"text": "= 6 × 42.25 m² = 253.5 m²", "conf": 0.814, "box": [[454, 1603], [879, 1612], [879, 1649], [453, 1641]]}, {"text": "Cost of painting 1 metre square area", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[103, 1652], [702, 1675], [701, 1718], [102, 1695]]}, {"text": "= Rs 45", "conf": 0.752, "box": [[793, 1675], [923, 1677], [923, 1714], [793, 1712]]}, {"text": "Cost of painting 253.5 metre square area = Rs 45 × 253.5 = Rs 11407.5", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[102, 1715], [1289, 1750], [1288, 1797], [101, 1761]]}, {"text": "So, the cost of painting the box is Rs 11407.5.", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[98, 1777], [847, 1798], [846, 1847], [97, 1826]]}, {"text": "Use variety of daily life examples to explain how to solve surface area and volume related", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[238, 1889], [1489, 1929], [1488, 1974], [236, 1934]]}, {"text": "questions. Then ask them to create some questions and solve them.", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[244, 1937], [1178, 1964], [1177, 2001], [243, 1974]]}, {"text": "162", "conf": 0.748, "box": [[792, 2087], [866, 2087], [866, 2127], [792, 2127]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[1187, 2098], [1497, 2114], [1495, 2147], [1185, 2131]]}]}